> these things and see if they fix your blue problem, though, anyway.

Doing that in fullscreen effectively resets the videomode to what your
video card wants to use - it loads its own character glyphs (rather than
the ones Windows NT uses) and resets the colors to the defaults (instead
of the colors you had configured).

